     1,
     "<div dir=\"ltr\">Hello ,<div>         I am looking to use RSelenium with ChromeDriver and I keep running into multiple problems. </div><div>     </div><div>         Based on the documentation of RSelenium , you can create an instance of Chrome Driver like so : </div><div><br></div><div>         cDrv &lt;- chrome(verbose = FALSE, check = FALSE)<br></div><div><br></div><div>         I am unable to find an example of how to : (<a href=\"https://github.com/johndharrison/wdman/blob/master/vignettes/basics.Rmd\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://github.com/johndharrison/wdman/blob/master/vignettes/basics.Rmd&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792389761087000&amp;usg=AOvVaw0ekzne8RoJGOXCPSKMs9WD\">https://github.com/johndharrison/wdman/blob/master/vignettes/basics.Rmd</a>) </div><blockquote style=\"margin:0px 0px 0px 0.8ex;border-left:1px solid rgb(204,204,204);padding-left:1ex\" class=\"gmail_quote\"><span style=\"font-weight:600;color:rgb(36,41,46);font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,&quot;Segoe UI&quot;,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif,&quot;Apple Color Emoji&quot;,&quot;Segoe UI Emoji&quot;,&quot;Segoe UI Symbol&quot;;font-size:16px\">       1. Pass arguments to the chrome driver (cDrv) . It takes a default</span><span style=\"font-weight:600;color:rgb(36,41,46);font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,&quot;Segoe UI&quot;,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif,&quot;Apple Color Emoji&quot;,&quot;Segoe UI Emoji&quot;,&quot;Segoe UI Symbol&quot;;font-size:16px\"> </span><code style=\"font-weight:600;color:rgb(36,41,46);box-sizing:border-box;font-family:SFMono-Regular,Consolas,&quot;Liberation Mono&quot;,Menlo,Courier,monospace;font-size:13.6px;padding-top:0.2em;padding-bottom:0.2em;background-color:rgba(27,31,35,0.05);border-radius:3px\">port</code><span style=\"font-weight:600;color:rgb(36,41,46);font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,&quot;Segoe UI&quot;,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif,&quot;Apple Color Emoji&quot;,&quot;Segoe UI Emoji&quot;,&quot;Segoe UI Symbol&quot;;font-size:16px\"> </span><span style=\"font-weight:600;color:rgb(36,41,46);font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,&quot;Segoe UI&quot;,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif,&quot;Apple Color Emoji&quot;,&quot;Segoe UI Emoji&quot;,&quot;Segoe UI Symbol&quot;;font-size:16px\">argument</span><span style=\"font-weight:600;color:rgb(36,41,46);font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,&quot;Segoe UI&quot;,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif,&quot;Apple Color Emoji&quot;,&quot;Segoe UI Emoji&quot;,&quot;Segoe UI Symbol&quot;;font-size:16px\"> </span><code style=\"font-weight:600;color:rgb(36,41,46);box-sizing:border-box;font-family:SFMono-Regular,Consolas,&quot;Liberation Mono&quot;,Menlo,Courier,monospace;font-size:13.6px;padding-top:0.2em;padding-bottom:0.2em;background-color:rgba(27,31,35,0.05);border-radius:3px\">port = 4567L</code><span style=\"font-weight:600;color:rgb(36,41,46);font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,&quot;Segoe UI&quot;,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif,&quot;Apple Color Emoji&quot;,&quot;Segoe UI Emoji&quot;,&quot;Segoe UI Symbol&quot;;font-size:16px\">.<br></span><span style=\"font-weight:600;color:rgb(36,41,46);font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,&quot;Segoe UI&quot;,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif,&quot;Apple Color Emoji&quot;,&quot;Segoe UI Emoji&quot;,&quot;Segoe UI Symbol&quot;;font-size:16px\">       2. Users can then connect directly to the chrome driver to drive a chrome browser. <br></span>Similarly to the <code style=\"box-sizing:border-box;font-family:SFMono-Regular,Consolas,&quot;Liberation Mono&quot;,Menlo,Courier,monospace;font-size:13.6px;padding-top:0.2em;padding-bottom:0.2em;background-color:rgba(27,31,35,0.05);border-radius:3px\">selenium</code> function the <code style=\"box-sizing:border-box;font-family:SFMono-Regular,Consolas,&quot;Liberation Mono&quot;,Menlo,Courier,monospace;font-size:13.6px;padding-top:0.2em;padding-bottom:0.2em;background-color:rgba(27,31,35,0.05);border-radius:3px\">chrome</code> function returns a list of four functions and a handle to the underlying running process.</blockquote><p style=\"box-sizing:border-box;margin-bottom:16px;color:rgb(36,41,46);font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,&quot;Segoe UI&quot;,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif,&quot;Apple Color Emoji&quot;,&quot;Segoe UI Emoji&quot;,&quot;Segoe UI Symbol&quot;;font-size:16px\"><br></p><p style=\"box-sizing:border-box;margin-bottom:16px;color:rgb(36,41,46);font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,&quot;Segoe UI&quot;,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif,&quot;Apple Color Emoji&quot;,&quot;Segoe UI Emoji&quot;,&quot;Segoe UI Symbol&quot;;font-size:16px\">          Can someone point me to a good example please ? </p><p style=\"box-sizing:border-box;margin-bottom:16px;color:rgb(36,41,46);font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,&quot;Segoe UI&quot;,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif,&quot;Apple Color Emoji&quot;,&quot;Segoe UI Emoji&quot;,&quot;Segoe UI Symbol&quot;;font-size:16px\"><br></p><p style=\"box-sizing:border-box;margin-bottom:16px;color:rgb(36,41,46);font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,&quot;Segoe UI&quot;,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif,&quot;Apple Color Emoji&quot;,&quot;Segoe UI Emoji&quot;,&quot;Segoe UI Symbol&quot;;font-size:16px\">Best <br></p><p style=\"box-sizing:border-box;margin-bottom:16px;color:rgb(36,41,46);font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,&quot;Segoe UI&quot;,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif,&quot;Apple Color Emoji&quot;,&quot;Segoe UI Emoji&quot;,&quot;Segoe UI Symbol&quot;;font-size:16px\">Uday </p><div><br></div><div><br></div><div><br></div></div>"
