    [
     1,
     "<div dir=\"ltr\">Hi Uday,<div>The following worked for me. I hope it helps.</div><div>Alan</div><div><br></div><div><div>install.packages(&quot;RSelenium&quot;) # RSelenium 1.7.1</div><div>library(wdman)</div><div>library(RSelenium)</div><div>cdrv &lt;- chrome(verbose = FALSE, check = FALSE, port = 4567L) # check = TRUE downloads executable if missing</div><div>rdrv &lt;- RSelenium::remoteDriver$new(remoteServerAddr = &quot;localhost&quot;, port = 4567L)</div><div>rdrv$open()</div><div>rdrv$navigate(&quot;<a href=\"https://www.rstudio.com/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://www.rstudio.com/&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792389761091000&amp;usg=AOvVaw3OQ66Pcw_fK8v_NsXKNpeG\">https://www.rstudio.com/</a>&quot;)</div><div>rdrv$getTitle()</div><div>rdrv$quit()</div></div></div>"
    ],
    [
     3,
     "<div dir=\"ltr\"><div><br>On Wednesday, May 31, 2017 at 2:42:29 PM UTC-7, Uday Guntupalli wrote:<blockquote class=\"gmail_quote\" style=\"margin:0;margin-left:0.8ex;border-left:1px #ccc solid;padding-left:1ex\"><div dir=\"ltr\">Hello ,<div>         I am looking to use RSelenium with ChromeDriver and I keep running into multiple problems. </div><div>     </div><div>         Based on the documentation of RSelenium , you can create an instance of Chrome Driver like so : </div><div><br></div><div>         cDrv &lt;- chrome(verbose = FALSE, check = FALSE)<br></div><div><br></div><div>         I am unable to find an example of how to : (<a href=\"https://github.com/johndharrison/wdman/blob/master/vignettes/basics.Rmd\" rel=\"nofollow\" target=\"_blank\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://github.com/johndharrison/wdman/blob/master/vignettes/basics.Rmd&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792389761091000&amp;usg=AOvVaw2tk0R9H8vTVwy8XsQDwkdB\">https://github.com/johndharrison/wdman/blob/master/vignettes/basics.Rmd</a>) </div><blockquote style=\"margin:0px 0px 0px 0.8ex;border-left:1px solid rgb(204,204,204);padding-left:1ex\" class=\"gmail_quote\"><span style=\"font-weight:600;color:rgb(36,41,46);font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,&quot;Segoe UI&quot;,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif,&quot;Apple Color Emoji&quot;,&quot;Segoe UI Emoji&quot;,&quot;Segoe UI Symbol&quot;;font-size:16px\">       1. Pass arguments to the chrome driver (cDrv) . It takes a default</span><span style=\"font-weight:600;color:rgb(36,41,46);font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,&quot;Segoe UI&quot;,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif,&quot;Apple Color Emoji&quot;,&quot;Segoe UI Emoji&quot;,&quot;Segoe UI Symbol&quot;;font-size:16px\"> </span><code style=\"font-weight:600;color:rgb(36,41,46);font-family:SFMono-Regular,Consolas,&quot;Liberation Mono&quot;,Menlo,Courier,monospace;font-size:13.6px;padding-top:0.2em;padding-bottom:0.2em;background-color:rgba(27,31,35,0.05);border-radius:3px\">port</code><span style=\"font-weight:600;color:rgb(36,41,46);font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,&quot;Segoe UI&quot;,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif,&quot;Apple Color Emoji&quot;,&quot;Segoe UI Emoji&quot;,&quot;Segoe UI Symbol&quot;;font-size:16px\"> </span><span style=\"font-weight:600;color:rgb(36,41,46);font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,&quot;Segoe UI&quot;,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif,&quot;Apple Color Emoji&quot;,&quot;Segoe UI Emoji&quot;,&quot;Segoe UI Symbol&quot;;font-size:16px\">argument</span><span style=\"font-weight:600;color:rgb(36,41,46);font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,&quot;Segoe UI&quot;,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif,&quot;Apple Color Emoji&quot;,&quot;Segoe UI Emoji&quot;,&quot;Segoe UI Symbol&quot;;font-size:16px\"> </span><code style=\"font-weight:600;color:rgb(36,41,46);font-family:SFMono-Regular,Consolas,&quot;Liberation Mono&quot;,Menlo,Courier,monospace;font-size:13.6px;padding-top:0.2em;padding-bottom:0.2em;background-color:rgba(27,31,35,0.05);border-radius:3px\">port = 4567L</code><span style=\"font-weight:600;color:rgb(36,41,46);font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,&quot;Segoe UI&quot;,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif,&quot;Apple Color Emoji&quot;,&quot;Segoe UI Emoji&quot;,&quot;Segoe UI Symbol&quot;;font-size:16px\">.<br></span><span style=\"font-weight:600;color:rgb(36,41,46);font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,&quot;Segoe UI&quot;,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif,&quot;Apple Color Emoji&quot;,&quot;Segoe UI Emoji&quot;,&quot;Segoe UI Symbol&quot;;font-size:16px\">       2. Users can then connect directly to the chrome driver to drive a chrome browser. <br></span>Similarly to the <code style=\"font-family:SFMono-Regular,Consolas,&quot;Liberation Mono&quot;,Menlo,Courier,monospace;font-size:13.6px;padding-top:0.2em;padding-bottom:0.2em;background-color:rgba(27,31,35,0.05);border-radius:3px\">selenium</code> function the <code style=\"font-family:SFMono-Regular,Consolas,&quot;Liberation Mono&quot;,Menlo,Courier,monospace;font-size:13.6px;padding-top:0.2em;padding-bottom:0.2em;background-color:rgba(27,31,35,0.05);border-radius:3px\">chrome</code> function returns a list of four functions and a handle to the underlying running process.</blockquote><p style=\"margin-bottom:16px;color:rgb(36,41,46);font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,&quot;Segoe UI&quot;,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif,&quot;Apple Color Emoji&quot;,&quot;Segoe UI Emoji&quot;,&quot;Segoe UI Symbol&quot;;font-size:16px\"><br></p><p style=\"margin-bottom:16px;color:rgb(36,41,46);font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,&quot;Segoe UI&quot;,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif,&quot;Apple Color Emoji&quot;,&quot;Segoe UI Emoji&quot;,&quot;Segoe UI Symbol&quot;;font-size:16px\">          Can someone point me to a good example please ? </p><p style=\"margin-bottom:16px;color:rgb(36,41,46);font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,&quot;Segoe UI&quot;,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif,&quot;Apple Color Emoji&quot;,&quot;Segoe UI Emoji&quot;,&quot;Segoe UI Symbol&quot;;font-size:16px\"><br></p><p style=\"margin-bottom:16px;color:rgb(36,41,46);font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,&quot;Segoe UI&quot;,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif,&quot;Apple Color Emoji&quot;,&quot;Segoe UI Emoji&quot;,&quot;Segoe UI Symbol&quot;;font-size:16px\">Best <br></p><p style=\"margin-bottom:16px;color:rgb(36,41,46);font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,&quot;Segoe UI&quot;,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif,&quot;Apple Color Emoji&quot;,&quot;Segoe UI Emoji&quot;,&quot;Segoe UI Symbol&quot;;font-size:16px\">Uday </p><div><br></div><div><br></div><div><br></div></div></blockquote></div></div>"
